"- button \"关闭窗口\"\n- button \"最小化窗口\"\n- button \"缩放窗口\"\n- tablist \"Workspace surface\":\n  - tab \"Echo\" [selected]:\n    - generic: Echo\n  - tab \"AI 浏览器\":\n- button \"收起侧栏 (⌘B)\" [expanded]:\n- button \"新建任务\":\n  - generic: 新建任务\n- list:\n  - link \"HUB\":\n    - /url: \"#/workspace/agents?surface=chat\"\n    - generic: HUB\n  - link \"助手\":\n    - /url: \"#/workspace/realtime/octopus-assistant?agent=octopus\"\n    - generic: 助手\n  - link \"订阅\":\n    - /url: \"#/workspace/intelligence?surface=chat\"\n    - generic: 订阅\n  - link \"项目管理\":\n    - /url: \"#/workspace/projects\"\n    - generic: 项目管理\n  - link \"设计画布\":\n    - /url: \"#/workspace/design\"\n    - generic: 设计画布\n  - link \"叙事工坊\":\n    - /url: \"#/workspace/narrative\"\n    - generic: 叙事工坊\n  - link \"自进化\":\n    - /url: \"#/workspace/evolution?surface=chat\"\n    - generic: 自进化\n- list:\n  - link \"发现社区\":\n    - /url: \"#/workspace/community\"\n    - generic: 发现社区\n- list:\n  - button \"展开本地数据库\":\n    - generic: 本地数据库\n- list:\n  - button \"编辑侧栏\":\n- button \"收起项目\" [expanded]:\n  - generic: 项目\n- button \"选择项目空间\":\n- button \"live-codex-workspace 5\":\n  - generic: live-codex-workspace\n  - generic: \"5\"\n- button \"更多：live-codex-workspace\":\n- button \"收起对话\" [expanded]:\n  - generic: 对话\n- button \"对话 · 新建任务\":\n- list:\n  - link \"研究eight sleep专利布局方向 1h\":\n    - /url: \"#/workspace/realtime/tVzjQc51k71eLx8xYMQu1j\"\n    - generic: 研究eight sleep专利布局方向\n    - generic: 1h\n  - button \"更多\":\n  - link \"调研智能睡眠 5h\":\n    - /url: \"#/workspace/realtime/tnwquwTzTuEqf3gj5PD4hm\"\n    - generic: 调研智能睡眠\n    - generic: 5h\n  - button \"更多\":\n- button \"Eve\":\n  - generic: Eve\n- button \"设置\":\n- main:\n  - complementary:\n    - heading \"架构探索\" [level=1]\n    - paragraph: docs/architecture/ 下的手写设计文档 · Mermaid 代码块自动渲染\n    - navigation:\n      - generic: 入口\n      - list:\n        - button \"README · 入口\"\n        - button \"核心路径 5+3+5+6\"\n      - generic: 高清图\n      - list:\n        - button \"高清架构图 (ASCII)\"\n        - button \"高清架构图 (Mermaid)\"\n      - generic: 专题\n      - list:\n        - button \"Chat 模式对照\"\n        - button \"ReAct 自进化闭环\"\n        - button \"器官分层(维护)\"\n        - button \"模块地图\"\n      - generic: 核心器官\n      - list:\n        - button \"🧠 Cerebrum · 中枢脑\"\n        - button \"🧬 Ganglia · 神经节\"\n        - button \"🐦 Beak · 工具执行\"\n        - button \"❤️ Hearts · 调度 facade\" [active]\n        - button \"🎨 Chromatophores · arm 广播\"\n  - main:\n    - heading \"❤️❤️❤️ Hearts · 三颗心脏（双循环隔离）\" [level=1]\n    - paragraph: 生物原型：章鱼有 3 颗心脏，做两种完全不同的循环：\n    - list:\n      - listitem: 体循环（Systemic）：1 颗系统心，把含氧血推向全身 —— 内部运作\n      - listitem: 鳃循环（Branchial）：2 颗鳃心，推血过鳃做气体交换 —— 与外界交互\n      - listitem: 两套循环物理隔离 —— 鳃部异常时体循环不会立即崩溃\n    - heading \"核心架构原则：双循环隔离\" [level=2]\n    - blockquote:\n      - paragraph: 外部 I/O 和内部业务必须走两套独立的\"心跳\"。 一个 API 挂了不该拖死整个 agent 循环。\n    - paragraph: 这是经典的 Bulkhead Isolation（舱壁隔离）模式，章鱼生理学直接给了它天然对应。\n    - heading \"新分工\" [level=2]\n    - button \"Copy table as markdown\":\n    - button \"Download table\":\n    - table:\n      - rowgroup:\n        - row \"心脏 对应生物 驱动的事 失效影响\":\n          - columnheader \"心脏\"\n          - columnheader \"对应生物\"\n          - columnheader \"驱动的事\"\n          - columnheader \"失效影响\"\n      - rowgroup:\n        - row \"Systemic Heart ×1 体循环 内部业务主循环：Cerebrum tick、会话状态、任务编排 业务停摆\":\n          - cell \"Systemic Heart ×1\"\n          - cell \"体循环\"\n          - cell \"内部业务主循环：Cerebrum tick、会话状态、任务编排\"\n          - cell \"业务停摆\"\n        - row \"Branchial Heart A ×1 左鳃心 外部 I/O 循环 A：LLM Provider 调用、MCP 远程调用 外部调用受阻，业务降级\":\n          - cell \"Branchial Heart A ×1\"\n          - cell \"左鳃心\"\n          - cell \"外部 I/O 循环 A：LLM Provider 调用、MCP 远程调用\"\n          - cell \"外部调用受阻，业务降级\"\n        - row \"Branchial Heart B ×1 右鳃心 外部 I/O 循环 B：第三方 API、webhook、集成协议 同上\":\n          - cell \"Branchial Heart B ×1\"\n          - cell \"右鳃心\"\n          - cell \"外部 I/O 循环 B：第三方 API、webhook、集成协议\"\n          - cell \"同上\"\n    - heading \"为什么这样分 —— 三个真实好处\" [level=2]\n    - heading \"1. 离线降级\" [level=3]\n    - paragraph: 外部 API 全挂时，Systemic Heart 仍跳动，系统仍能：\n    - list:\n      - listitem: 读本地缓存回复（与 Spinal Cord 配合）\n      - listitem: 把任务入队等外部恢复\n      - listitem: 维持用户会话不断线\n    - heading \"2. 阻塞隔离\" [level=3]\n    - paragraph: LLM provider 300ms 抖动不会把主循环阻塞。外部调用全部异步发到 Branchial 通道。\n    - heading \"3. 独立背压\" [level=3]\n    - paragraph: I/O 压力大时只降鳃心频率，不影响业务节律；反之亦然。\n    - heading \"接口\" [level=2]\n    - generic: python\n    - button \"Download file\":\n    - button:\n    - code:\n      - generic: \"class Hearts:\"\n      - generic: \"systemic: SystemicHeart # 内部业务节拍\"\n      - generic: \"branchial_a: BranchialHeart # 外部 I/O 通道 A\"\n      - generic: \"branchial_b: BranchialHeart # 外部 I/O 通道 B\"\n      - generic: \"def beat(self): ... # 各自独立 tick\"\n      - generic: \"def dispatch_io(self, call) -> Future:\"\n      - generic: \"# 路由到 A 或 B（负载均衡 / API 类型分区）\"\n    - heading \"心跳节律（各自独立可调）\" [level=2]\n    - button \"Copy table as markdown\":\n    - button \"Download table\":\n    - table:\n      - rowgroup:\n        - row \"心脏 正常 预算紧张 外部降级\":\n          - columnheader \"心脏\"\n          - columnheader \"正常\"\n          - columnheader \"预算紧张\"\n          - columnheader \"外部降级\"\n      - rowgroup:\n        - row \"Systemic 500ms 2s 不变（本地业务继续）\":\n          - cell \"Systemic\"\n          - cell \"500ms\"\n          - cell \"2s\"\n          - cell \"不变（本地业务继续）\"\n        - row \"Branchial A/B 200ms 1s 大幅降频 / 暂停\":\n          - cell \"Branchial A/B\"\n          - cell \"200ms\"\n          - cell \"1s\"\n          - cell \"大幅降频 / 暂停\"\n    - heading \"与 HA 的关系\" [level=2]\n    - paragraph:\n      - text: HA 不是 Hearts 的首要职责（交给\n      - code: hearts.count\n      - text: 多实例 + Raft quorum 做）。 Hearts 的首要职责是功能隔离，HA 是派生能力。\n    - heading \"进化关联\" [level=2]\n    - list:\n      - listitem: ⑥ 成本治理：Branchial 独立节律是外部 API 成本节流的主闸\n      - listitem: ⑤ 分布式执行：两套循环让 edge/cloud 协同更自然（内部可纯本地，外部走云）\n    - heading \"一句话原则\" [level=2]\n    - blockquote:\n      - paragraph: 双循环是生物界几亿年的答案：把\"与外界交互\"和\"维持自己活着\"分开。 用在 Agent OS 就是 —— 别让一次 API 超时把你整个 agent 冻住。\n    - separator\n    - heading \"Implementation Map · 当前代码里怎么落地\" [level=2]\n    - paragraph:\n      - text: bulkhead 不是一个\n      - code: Hearts\n      - text: 类 —— 是分布在 5 个组件里的组合拳。\n      - text: 未来如果真要集中成\n      - code: runtime/hearts/\n      - text: ，也是一个聚合 facade，不是重新发明。\n    - button \"Copy table as markdown\":\n    - button \"Download table\":\n    - table:\n      - rowgroup:\n        - row \"设计层面 现有实现\":\n          - columnheader \"设计层面\"\n          - columnheader \"现有实现\"\n      - rowgroup:\n        - row \"主业务循环（Systemic）· 常驻 daemon 线程跑定时任务 runtime/scheduler/ · BackgroundRunner\":\n          - cell \"主业务循环（Systemic）· 常驻 daemon 线程跑定时任务\"\n          - cell \"runtime/scheduler/ · BackgroundRunner\":\n            - code: runtime/scheduler/\n            - text: ·\n            - code: BackgroundRunner\n        - row \"外部 I/O 节拍（Branchial）· LLM/MCP 调用保护 runtime/ink/breaker_router.py · BreakerModelRouter + CircuitBreaker\":\n          - cell \"外部 I/O 节拍（Branchial）· LLM/MCP 调用保护\"\n          - cell \"runtime/ink/breaker_router.py · BreakerModelRouter + CircuitBreaker\":\n            - code: runtime/ink/breaker_router.py\n            - text: ·\n            - code: BreakerModelRouter\n            - text: +\n            - code: CircuitBreaker\n        - row \"外部 I/O 异步隔离 · subprocess 阻塞不回传主线程 runtime/mcp_client/persistent_client.py · 后台 asyncio loop + run_coroutine_threadsafe\":\n          - cell \"外部 I/O 异步隔离 · subprocess 阻塞不回传主线程\"\n          - cell \"runtime/mcp_client/persistent_client.py · 后台 asyncio loop + run_coroutine_threadsafe\":\n            - code: runtime/mcp_client/persistent_client.py\n            - text: · 后台 asyncio loop +\n            - code: run_coroutine_threadsafe\n        - row \"执行层并发隔离（腕间） runtime/swarm/runtime.py · ThreadPoolExecutor\":\n          - cell \"执行层并发隔离（腕间）\"\n          - cell \"runtime/swarm/runtime.py · ThreadPoolExecutor\":\n            - code: runtime/swarm/runtime.py\n            - text: · ThreadPoolExecutor\n        - row \"进程级隔离（不可信 skill） runtime/mantle/subprocess_mantle.py\":\n          - cell \"进程级隔离（不可信 skill）\"\n          - cell \"runtime/mantle/subprocess_mantle.py\":\n            - code: runtime/mantle/subprocess_mantle.py\n        - row \"长跑进程入口 · 把上面全部组装 octopus-agent serve --config X.yaml --port 8000\":\n          - cell \"长跑进程入口 · 把上面全部组装\"\n          - cell \"octopus-agent serve --config X.yaml --port 8000\":\n            - code: octopus-agent serve --config X.yaml --port 8000\n    - heading \"serve 子命令 · Systemic 的真实入口\" [level=3]:\n      - code: serve\n      - text: 子命令 · Systemic 的真实入口\n    - generic: bash\n    - button \"Download file\":\n    - button:\n    - code:\n      - generic: octopus-agent serve \\\n      - generic: \"--config config.yaml \\\\\"\n      - generic: \"--port 8000 \\\\\"\n      - generic: \"--learn-interval 3600 # 每小时反思一次（可选）\"\n    - paragraph: 行为：\n    - list:\n      - code: BackgroundRunner.start()\n      - text: · 后台 daemon 线程\n      - text: 把\n      - code: config.intel_sources\n      - text: 的每一项按\n      - code: frequency_seconds\n      - text: 挂成 periodic 任务\n      - text: 可选：按\n      - code: \"--learn-interval\"\n      - text: 定时跑\n      - code: learn_from_journal\n      - text: /\n      - code: learn_memories_from_journal\n      - listitem: 启动 FastAPI UI（与 scheduler 共享同一 journal + registry）\n      - listitem: Ctrl-C / SIGTERM → 优雅 stop scheduler + uvicorn + 打印任务统计\n    - heading \"为什么不叫 Hearts\" [level=3]\n    - list:\n      - code: BackgroundRunner\n      - text: 单线程足够 —— \"三颗心\"的 2 鳃心分池在当前用例下就是一个 ThreadPoolExecutor 换皮\n      - text: 真需要按 I/O 类型分池（LLM 热路径 vs webhook 事件流），给\n      - code: BackgroundRunner\n      - text: 加\n      - code: ThreadPoolExecutor(pool=...)\n      - text: 参数即可，不必重起一个\n      - code: hearts/\n      - text: 目录\n    - heading \"现状：聚合 facade 已落地（runtime/hearts/）\" [level=2]:\n      - text: 现状：聚合 facade 已落地（\n      - code: runtime/hearts/\n      - text: ）\n    - paragraph: ~100 行的聚合 facade · 不重新发明任何东西：\n    - generic: python\n    - button \"Download file\":\n    - button:\n    - code:\n      - generic: from runtime.core.hearts import Hearts\n      - generic: from runtime.adapters.scheduler import BackgroundRunner\n      - generic: from runtime.safety.budget_breaker import CircuitBreaker\n      - generic: hearts = Hearts(\n      - generic: systemic=BackgroundRunner(),\n      - generic: \"branchial={\"\n      - generic: \"\\\"llm\\\": CircuitBreaker(...),\"\n      - generic: \"\\\"mcp\\\": CircuitBreaker(...),\"\n      - generic: \"},\"\n      - generic: )\n      - generic: \"with hearts:\"\n      - generic: \"breaker = hearts.dispatch_io(\\\"llm\\\") # 拿通道 breaker 包 I/O\"\n      - generic: breaker.check()\n      - generic: ...\n      - generic: \"if not hearts.healthy(): # 统一健康探针\"\n      - generic: ...\n      - generic: \"snap = hearts.snapshot() # JSON 可序列化 · 喂 UI / OTel\"\n    - paragraph: 存在价值：\n    - list:\n      - code: serve\n      - text: 入口一行 lifecycle（\n      - code: \"with hearts:\"\n      - text: ）· 不用手攒各组件 start/stop\n      - text: UI / OTel 单点\n      - code: hearts.snapshot()\n      - text: 拿全链路健康\n      - text: bulkhead 双循环原则在代码层可\n      - code: from runtime.core.hearts import Hearts\n      - text: 发现\n    - paragraph: 不做什么：\n    - list:\n      - listitem: 不重新包 scheduler / breaker · 纯组合\n      - listitem: 不搞独立心跳线程 · systemic 心跳=scheduler 主循环 · branchial 是惰性状态机\n      - listitem: 不做多节律 / pool 分池 / HA —— 真遇到再扩\n    - heading \"结构图(去诗化版)\" [level=2]\n    - button \"Download file\":\n    - button:\n    - img \"Mermaid chart\":\n      - img \"Diagram source\":\n        - generic: \"flowchart TB subgraph hearts[❤️ Hearts facade] direction TB sched[BackgroundRunner<br/><b>= Scheduler</b><br/>内部业务主循环] cbGroup[CircuitBreaker × N<br/><b>= CircuitBreakerGroup</b><br/>每个外部 I/O 通道一个] coord[Coordinator<br/><b>= HA leader 选举</b><br/>Redis / etcd / InMemory] end entry([serve 入口]) snap([snapshot JSON]) external[外部 LB / OTel] entry -- with hearts: ... --> hearts hearts --> snap --> external truth{{🚫 不是字面 3 颗心脏<br/>✅ Scheduler + CBGroup + Coordinator 的 facade}} hearts -.-> truth style hearts fill:#fecaca,stroke:#991b1b style truth fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#92400e\"\n- region \"Notifications alt+T\""